    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d797">

                <pb facs="0930" n="812" sameAs="frus:frus1928v02/pg812"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.5112 U.S./7</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The French Ambassador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Claudel</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-01-07"><hi rendition="#italic">January 7,
                        1928</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Secretary of State</hi>: By note of the 28th of
                    December last your Excellency was good enough to transmit the text of a draft of
                    a treaty of arbitration between France and the United States to replace the
                    convention which expires at the end of next month.</p>
                <p>M. Briand, to whom I have not failed to telegraph the text, has suggested certain
                    modifications of which I told you verbally yesterday. <pb facs="0931" n="813"
                        xml:id="pg813"/> He sent me a draft containing these modifications. I have
                    the honor to transmit these attached hereto to your Excellency.</p>
                <p>Accept [etc.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Claudel</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d797-a1.xml" xpointer="d797-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
